@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/stream_topics/
actor "The client ." as Client
participant "WorkspaceStreamTopicController\nRestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\ncanonical lines + brackets" as DB
queue "Transactional outbox\n+ Typed tasks" as Outbox
participant "Background performers\nexact scope leases + fencing" as Worker
database "Ready projections\nThe container is tied up ." as Projection
database "The public events repository" as Events
participant "The controller . WebSocket" as Dispatcher
actor "The client . WebSocket" as WS
Client -> API: POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/stream_topics/
API -> DB: The start of the transaction; TOPIC + USER_TOPIC_BINDING The creator
API -> DB: Add a record to the transactional outbox
DB --> API: The transaction is recorded
API --> Client: A successful public response
DB ->> Outbox: the event that was recorded
Outbox ->> Worker: topic_membership_policy_rebuild / topic_state_projection /\ndelivery_snapshot_event\neach task It has its own outbox_event_uuid
Worker -> Worker: claim exact scope; For the topic work\nMESSAGE.created_at DESC
Worker -> Projection: The rest of the lines USER_TOPIC_BINDING
Worker -> Events: topic.created\natomically in one. DB transaction with a projection
Events ->> Dispatcher: fixed ready line
Dispatcher ->> WS: I 'm going to send / repeat / reproduce
@enduml
